          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä bä nyuuthni ŋun, nhial kɛnɛ piny, riɛm kɛnɛ mac kɛ wuɔ̱n tuɔɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi cäŋ riet ala muth, kä bi pay riet ala riɛm a /ken cäŋ Kuɔth Nhial ni ben cäŋ bɛcä in di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn tin diaal tin cɔalkɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial bikɛ cu kään, nikɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar ba ka̱n jek pääm Dha-yɔn kɛnɛ rɛk Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, rɛy nɛɛni tin ci kään ba tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn kuany ɛ Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
